# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.unknown-nested-property {
  border: {
    foo: 1px;
  }
}

.unknown-combined-name {
  font: {
    color: red;
  }
}

.unknown-in-nested-group {
  border: {
    top: {
      bar: 1px;
    }
  }
}

$bold: true;
.unknown-in-at-rule-in-group {
  font: {
    @if $bold {
      color: red;
    }
  }
}

```

# Diagnostics
