invalid.nested.scss:4:5 lint/correctness/noUnknownProperty ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  × Unknown property is not allowed.
  
    2 │ .unknown-nested-property {
    3 │   border: {
  > 4 │     foo: 1px;
      │     ^^^
    5 │   }
    6 │ }
  
  i Sass emits this nested property as border-foo.
  
  i Browsers ignore properties they do not know, so the declaration has no effect. An unknown property is often a typo.
  
  i Use a known CSS property instead.
  
  i See CSS Specifications and browser specific properties for more details.
  

```

